      "items": [
        {
          "text": "The only lerasium known came as a few beads at the Well of Ascension.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "lost-metal", "chapter": "71" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Two beads lay near the Well, unused before the Final Empire fell. One was fed to Elend Venture to save his life after he was mortally wounded.",
