        {
          "text": "New lerasium",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "lost-metal", "chapter": "epilogue-4" }]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wax split harmonium with trellium to make more lerasium. He and Wayne used it, becoming the first Mistborn known since the Lord Mistborn soon after the Catacendre.",
          "revealedIn": [{ "book": "lost-metal", "chapter": "epilogue-4" }]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelsier wanted the new lerasium to raise an army against Autonomy's forces, but Harmony refused.",
